    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97796" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκινδῡν-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>incur danger along with</i> others, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τισι</span>
